* Common-collector input characteristic (NPN 2N3904)
* collector at the common (ground) node, emitter supply VEE = -1 ... -4 V
* (VCE = |VEE|).  inner sweep: VBB (referred to ground, so x = VBC)
* outer sweep: VEE (emitter supply)
VEE 0 nes 0
RE nes e 0.1
Q1 0 b e Q2N3904
VBB nbs 0 0
RB nbs b 22k
.MODEL Q2N3904 NPN(IS=6.734F XTI=3 EG=1.11 VAF=74.03 BF=416.4 NE=1.259
+ ISE=6.734F IKF=.06678 XTB=1.5 BR=.7371 NC=2 ISC=0 IKR=0 RC=1
+ CJC=3.638P MJC=.3085 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=4.493P MJE=.2593 VJE=.75
+ TR=239.5N TF=301.2P ITF=.4 VTF=4 XTF=2 RB=10)
.SAVE all @q1[ic] @q1[ib] @q1[ie]
.DC VBB -5 3 0.01 VEE 1 4 1
.PROBE
.END
